--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WEB SOURCE PARITY MAP (no scope narrowing)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The web `TeslaReauthBanner` is a self-driven status banner mounted in <Layout>. It listens to two
document-level events — `teslasync:tesla-auth-expired` (dispatched by resilientFetch on a 401
TESLA_TOKEN_EXPIRED) and `teslasync:tesla-auth-recovered` (emitted by <TeslaAccountSection> after the
OAuth flow completes). It toggles a `visible` flag: shows a sticky role="alert" / aria-live="assertive"
row while the Tesla refresh token is expired, deep-links to `/tesla-account` on "Reconnect", hides on
"Dismiss", and on recovery replays the queued Tesla mutations via drainQueuedTeslaMutations().

Native reproduction (SwiftUI + HIG, iOS 18 / iPadOS 18 / macOS 15; ADR-002 shared source group):
  • data hooks (web)         -> native binding (P1/S8 state holders)
      useTranslation           -> TeslaReauthStrings facade (P1/S10) + injected TeslaReauthResolve seam
      useNavigate('/tesla-account') -> injected `onReconnect` @MainActor action seam (composition root
                                       wires the deep-link; the view never imports a router — DIP)
      document tesla-auth events -> TeslaReauthSource seam emitting a coalesced TeslaReauthInput
                                    (grant status + load/connectivity); the recovery edge fires the
                                    injected `onRecovered` seam = web drainQueuedTeslaMutations()
  • shared components (web @/components/ui) -> native P3 shared components:
      web Button (primary/sm)  -> TSButton(variant:.primary,size:.small)
      web AlertBanner shell     -> warning-toned banner treatment (ADR-006 semantic: web amber ->
                                   Color.TS.statusWarning), same tone the shared TSAlertBanner uses
      retry/empty/error chrome  -> TSButton / TSEmptyState / TSCard / TSSkeleton (P3)
  • charts/maps: none in the web source (none added).

